          <button type="button" class="dgn-hm__node" style="--i:4" aria-pressed="false"><span class="dgn-hm__dot"><svg><use href="#dgn-hm-hayit"/></svg></span><span class="dgn-hm__lbl">Hayıt</span></button>
          <button type="button" class="dgn-hm__node" style="--i:5" aria-pressed="false"><span class="dgn-hm__dot"><svg><use href="#dgn-hm-magnezyum"/></svg></span><span class="dgn-hm__lbl">Magnezyum</span></button>
          <button type="button" class="dgn-hm__node dgn-hm__node--up" style="--i:6" aria-pressed="false"><span class="dgn-hm__dot"><svg><use href="#dgn-hm-b6"/></svg></span><span class="dgn-hm__lbl">B6 vitamini</span></button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="dgn-hm__side">
        <div class="dgn-hm__cards" aria-live="polite">
          <article class="dgn-hm__card is-on">
            <div class="dgn-hm__ch"><span class="dgn-hm__ci"><svg><use href="#dgn-hm-karayilan"/></svg></span><div><h3 class="dgn-hm__cn">Karayılan otu</h3><p class="dgn-hm__cl">Black Cohosh · Actaea racemosa</p></div></div>
            <ul class="dgn-hm__tags"><li class="dgn-hm__tag--on">Sıcak basması</li><li>Kök · günde 40 mg</li></ul>
            <p class="dgn-hm__cd">Kuzey Amerika kökenli bir bitkidir. Menopoz döneminde görülen sıcak basması, gece terlemesi, uyku sorunları ve ruh hali değişimleri için kullanılır.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="dgn-hm__card">
            <div class="dgn-hm__ch"><span class="dgn-hm__ci"><svg><use href="#dgn-hm-adacayi"/></svg></span><div><h3 class="dgn-hm__cn">Adaçayı</h3><p class="dgn-hm__cl">Salvia officinalis</p></div></div>
            <ul class="dgn-hm__tags"><li class="dgn-hm__tag--on">Sıcak basması</li><li>Yaprak · günde 100 mg</li></ul>
            <p class="dgn-hm__cd">Menopoz döneminde sık yaşanan sıcak basması ve gece terlemesi için kullanılır. 160'tan fazla polifenol içerir.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="dgn-hm__card">
            <div class="dgn-hm__ch"><span class="dgn-hm__ci"><svg><use href="#dgn-hm-melisa"/></svg></span><div><h3 class="dgn-hm__cn">Melisa (oğul otu)</h3><p class="dgn-hm__cl">Melissa officinalis</p></div></div>
            <ul class="dgn-hm__tags"><li class="dgn-hm__tag--on">Sakin akşamlar</li><li>Yaprak · günde 100 mg</li></ul>
            <p class="dgn-hm__cd">Sakinleştirici özelliğiyle bilinir. Gerginliği hafifletmek ve uykuya dalmayı kolaylaştırmak için geleneksel olarak kullanılır.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="dgn-hm__card">
            <div class="dgn-hm__ch"><span class="dgn-hm__ci"><svg><use href="#dgn-hm-serbetciotu"/></svg></span><div><h3 class="dgn-hm__cn">Şerbetçiotu</h3><p class="dgn-hm__cl">Humulus lupulus</p></div></div>
            <ul class="dgn-hm__tags"><li class="dgn-hm__tag--on">Uyku düzeni</li><li>Çiçek · günde 100 mg</li></ul>
            <p class="dgn-hm__cd">Doğal bir sakinleştirici olarak bilinir; uyku düzenini desteklemek için kullanılır.</p>
            <p class="dgn-hm__note">Doğal olarak fitoöstrojen içerir. Hormona duyarlı bir rahatsızlık geçmişin varsa kullanma.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="dgn-hm__card">
            <div class="dgn-hm__ch"><span class="dgn-hm__ci"><svg><use href="#dgn-hm-hayit"/></svg></span><div><h3 class="dgn-hm__cn">Hayıt</h3><p class="dgn-hm__cl">Vitex agnus-castus</p></div></div>
            <ul class="dgn-hm__tags"><li class="dgn-hm__tag--on">Hormonal dönemler</li><li>Meyve · günde 40 mg</li></ul>
            <p class="dgn-hm__cd">Akdeniz kökenli bir bitkidir. Kadınlarda hormonal dönemlere bağlı şikâyetlerde yüzyıllardır tercih edilir.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="dgn-hm__card">
            <div class="dgn-hm__ch"><span class="dgn-hm__ci"><svg><use href="#dgn-hm-magnezyum"/></svg></span><div><h3 class="dgn-hm__cn">Magnezyum</h3><p class="dgn-hm__cl">Mineral</p></div></div>
            <ul class="dgn-hm__tags"><li class="dgn-hm__tag--on">Kas ve sinir sistemi</li><li>Günde 50 mg · BRD %13</li></ul>
            <p class="dgn-hm__cd">Vücutta kas ve sinir sisteminin çalışmasında ve enerji üretiminde görev alan bir mineraldir.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="dgn-hm__card">
            <div class="dgn-hm__ch"><span class="dgn-hm__ci"><svg><use href="#dgn-hm-b6"/></svg></span><div><h3 class="dgn-hm__cn">B6 vitamini</h3><p class="dgn-hm__cl">Piridoksin</p></div></div>
            <ul class="dgn-hm__tags"><li class="dgn-hm__tag--on">Enerji</li><li>Günde 2 mg · BRD %143</li></ul>
            <p class="dgn-hm__cd">Yorgunluk ve bitkinliğin azalmasına, hormonal aktivitenin düzenlenmesine ve sinir sisteminin normal işleyişine katkıda bulunur.</p>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="dgn-hm__nav">
          <button type="button" class="dgn-hm__arw" data-dgn-prev aria-label="Önceki bileşen"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M15 5l-7 7 7 7"/></svg></button>
          <span class="dgn-hm__dots" aria-hidden="true"><i class="is-on"></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
          <button type="button" class="dgn-hm__arw" data-dgn-next aria-label="Sonraki bileşen"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></button>
        </div>

        <a class="dgn-hm__cta" href="#satin-al">Paketini seç</a>
        <p class="dgn-hm__foot">Miktarlar günlük 30 damla içindir. Takviye edici gıdadır, ilaç değildir.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .dgn-hm{--hm-g:var(--g,#1C6047);--hm-nane:var(--nane,#E8FFF6);--hm-ln:var(--ln,#DCE6E1);--hm-ink:var(--ink,#141414);--hm-mu:var(--mu,#4D5550);--hm-bg:var(--krem,#FFFAF4);--hm-n:60px;--hm-r:36%;background:var(--hm-bg);color:var(--hm-ink);padding:56px 16px;overflow:hidden}
  .dgn-hm *,.dgn-hm *::before,.dgn-hm *::after{box-sizing:border-box}
  .dgn-hm__sprite{position:absolute;width:0;height:0;overflow:hidden}
  .dgn-hm svg{fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.5;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
  .dgn-hm__in{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}
  .dgn-hm__head{text-align:center;margin:0 auto 20px;max-width:560px}
  .dgn-hm__eyebrow{margin:0 0 10px;font:800 13px/1 var(--hd,inherit);letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--hm-g)}
  .dgn-hm__title{margin:0;font-family:var(--hd,inherit);font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(28px,6.4vw,44px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--hm-g)}
  .dgn-hm__sub{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--hm-mu)}
  .dgn-hm__grid{display:grid;gap:20px;align-items:center}

  /* Sahne: şişe + taş + arkadaki adaçayı dalları + halka */
  .dgn-hm__stage{position:relative;width:100%;max-width:480px;margin:14px auto 0;aspect-ratio:1/1}
  .dgn-hm__ring{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:calc(var(--hm-r)*2);height:calc(var(--hm-r)*2);transform:translate(-50%,-50%);border:1.5px dashed var(--hm-ln);border-radius:50%}
  .dgn-hm__ring::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:12%;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,var(--hm-nane) 0%,rgba(232,255,246,.55) 45%,rgba(255,255,255,0) 72%)}
  .dgn-hm .dgn-hm__deko{position:absolute;left:50%;top:47%;width:52%;height:52%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);fill:#D6EEE1;stroke:none;opacity:.9;pointer-events:none}
  .dgn-hm .dgn-hm__deko .st{fill:none;stroke:#C3E3D2;stroke-width:2.2}
  .dgn-hm__podium{position:absolute;left:50%;top:75%;width:30%;height:7%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 35%,#FFFFFF 0%,#EFE8DD 55%,#DDD3C4 100%);box-shadow:0 8px 16px rgba(20,40,31,.12),inset 0 -2px 4px rgba(20,40,31,.06)}
  .dgn-hm__bottle{position:absolute;left:50%;top:48.5%;height:52%;width:auto;max-width:none;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);filter:drop-shadow(0 10px 12px rgba(20,40,31,.22));pointer-events:none}

  .dgn-hm button{-webkit-appearance:none;appearance:none;margin:0;padding:0;border:0;background:none;font:inherit;color:inherit;cursor:pointer;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
  .dgn-hm .dgn-hm__node{--a:calc(var(--i)*51.4286deg - 90deg);position:absolute;left:calc(50% + cos(var(--a))*var(--hm-r));top:calc(50% + sin(var(--a))*var(--hm-r));width:var(--hm-n);height:var(--hm-n);margin:calc(var(--hm-n)/-2) 0 0 calc(var(--hm-n)/-2);border-radius:50%}
  .dgn-hm__dot{--leaf:#D9F2E5;position:absolute;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid var(--hm-ln);color:var(--hm-g);box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(20,40,31,.10);transition:background .25s,color .25s,border-color .25s,transform .25s}
  .dgn-hm__dot svg{width:74%;height:74%}
  .dgn-hm__lbl{position:absolute;left:50%;top:calc(100% + 5px);transform:translateX(-50%);width:max-content;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--hm-bg);text-align:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;color:var(--hm-ink);transition:color .25s,background .25s}
  .dgn-hm__node--up .dgn-hm__lbl{top:auto;bottom:calc(100% + 5px)}
  .dgn-hm__node:hover .dgn-hm__dot{border-color:var(--hm-g)}
  .dgn-hm__node.is-on .dgn-hm__dot{--leaf:rgba(255,255,255,.2);background:var(--hm-g);border-color:var(--hm-g);color:#fff;transform:scale(1.1);box-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(28,96,71,.30)}
  .dgn-hm__node.is-on .dgn-hm__dot::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:-7px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid var(--hm-g);opacity:0;animation:dgn-hm-pulse 2.4s ease-out infinite}
  .dgn-hm__node.is-on .dgn-hm__lbl{color:#fff;background:var(--hm-g)}
  .dgn-hm__node:focus-visible{outline:none}
  .dgn-hm__node:focus-visible .dgn-hm__dot{box-shadow:0 0 0 3px #fff,0 0 0 5px var(--hm-g)}
  @keyframes dgn-hm-pulse{0%{transform:scale(.9);opacity:.55}100%{transform:scale(1.35);opacity:0}}

  /* Bölüm ekrana girince daireler sırayla belirir */
  .dgn-hm--anim .dgn-hm__node{opacity:0;scale:.6}
  .dgn-hm--anim.is-in .dgn-hm__node{opacity:1;scale:1;transition:opacity .45s ease,scale .55s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);transition-delay:calc(var(--i)*70ms)}

  .dgn-hm__side{width:100%;max-width:520px;margin:0 auto}
  .dgn-hm__card{display:none;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--hm-ln);border-radius:22px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(20,40,31,.07)}
  .dgn-hm__card.is-on{display:block;animation:dgn-hm-in .35s ease both}
  @keyframes dgn-hm-in{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
  .dgn-hm__ch{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
  .dgn-hm__ci{--leaf:#fff;flex:none;width:58px;height:58px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--hm-nane);color:var(--hm-g);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
  .dgn-hm__ci svg{width:40px;height:40px}
  .dgn-hm__cn{margin:0;font-family:var(--hd,inherit);font-size:21px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:var(--hm-ink)}
  .dgn-hm__cl{margin:3px 0 0;font-size:14px;font-style:italic;color:var(--hm-mu)}
  .dgn-hm__tags{list-style:none;margin:16px 0 0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}
  .dgn-hm__tags li{margin:0;padding:6px 11px;border-radius:999px;background:#F3F5F4;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;color:var(--hm-mu)}
  .dgn-hm__tags .dgn-hm__tag--on{background:var(--hm-nane);color:var(--hm-g)}
  .dgn-hm__cd{margin:14px 0 0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--hm-ink)}
  .dgn-hm__note{margin:12px 0 0;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:12px;background:#FFF6E8;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;color:#6B4A12}

  .dgn-hm__nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-top:14px}
  .dgn-hm__arw{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;border:1.5px solid var(--hm-ln)!important;background:#fff!important;color:var(--hm-g)!important;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;transition:border-color .2s}
  .dgn-hm__arw:hover{border-color:var(--hm-g)!important}
  .dgn-hm__arw svg{width:20px;height:20px;stroke-width:2}
  .dgn-hm__arw:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--hm-g);outline-offset:2px}
  .dgn-hm__dots{display:flex;gap:6px}
  .dgn-hm__dots i{display:block;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--hm-ln);transition:width .3s,background .3s}
  .dgn-hm__dots i.is-on{width:22px;background:var(--hm-g)}
  .dgn-hm__cta{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:54px;margin-top:18px;padding:0 24px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--hm-g);color:#fff!important;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.01em;text-decoration:none!important;box-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(28,96,71,.22);transition:filter .2s}
  .dgn-hm__cta:hover{filter:brightness(1.08)}
  .dgn-hm__cta:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--hm-g);outline-offset:3px}
  .dgn-hm__foot{margin:12px 0 0;text-align:center;font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:var(--hm-mu)}

  @media (min-width:900px){
    .dgn-hm{padding:88px 24px;--hm-n:72px}
    .dgn-hm__head{margin-bottom:32px}
    .dgn-hm__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:56px}
    .dgn-hm__lbl{font-size:13px}
    .dgn-hm__card{padding:28px}
    .dgn-hm__cn{font-size:24px}
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
    .dgn-hm__node.is-on .dgn-hm__dot::after{animation:none}
    .dgn-hm__card.is-on{animation:none}
    .dgn-hm--anim .dgn-hm__node{opacity:1;scale:1}
    .dgn-hm__dot,.dgn-hm__dots i{transition:none}
  }
</style>

<script>
  (function () {
    function init(root) {
      if (root.getAttribute('data-ready')) return;
      root.setAttribute('data-ready', '1');
      var nodes = [].slice.call(root.querySelectorAll('.dgn-hm__node'));
      var cards = [].slice.call(root.querySelectorAll('.dgn-hm__card'));
      var dots = [].slice.call(root.querySelectorAll('.dgn-hm__dots i'));
      var cur = 0;

      // Eski tarayıcılar CSS sin()/cos() bilmiyorsa halkayı burada diz.
      if (!(window.CSS && CSS.supports && CSS.supports('top', 'calc(1px * sin(1deg))'))) {
        nodes.forEach(function (n, k) {
          var a = (k * 360 / nodes.length - 90) * Math.PI / 180;
          n.style.left = (50 + Math.cos(a) * 36).toFixed(2) + '%';
          n.style.top = (50 + Math.sin(a) * 36).toFixed(2) + '%';
        });
      }

      // Ekrana girince daireleri sırayla göster.
      if ('IntersectionObserver' in window) {
        root.classList.add('dgn-hm--anim');
        var io = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries) {
          entries.forEach(function (e) {
            if (e.isIntersecting) { root.classList.add('is-in'); io.disconnect(); }
          });
        }, { threshold: 0.25 });
        io.observe(root.querySelector('.dgn-hm__stage'));
      }

      function show(i, focus) {
        cur = (i + nodes.length) % nodes.length;
        nodes.forEach(function (n, k) {
          n.classList.toggle('is-on', k === cur);
          n.setAttribute('aria-pressed', k === cur ? 'true' : 'false');
        });
        cards.forEach(function (c, k) { c.classList.toggle('is-on', k === cur); });
        dots.forEach(function (d, k) { d.classList.toggle('is-on', k === cur); });
        if (focus) nodes[cur].focus();
      }

      nodes.forEach(function (n, k) {
        n.addEventListener('click', function () { show(k); });
        n.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {
          if (e.key === 'ArrowRight' || e.key === 'ArrowDown') { e.preventDefault(); show(cur + 1, true); }
          if (e.key === 'ArrowLeft' || e.key === 'ArrowUp') { e.preventDefault(); show(cur - 1, true); }
        });
      });
      var prev = root.querySelector('[data-dgn-prev]');
      var next = root.querySelector('[data-dgn-next]');
      if (prev) prev.addEventListener('click', function () { show(cur - 1); });
      if (next) next.addEventListener('click', function () { show(cur + 1); });
    }
    [].forEach.call(document.querySelectorAll('[data-dgn-hm]'), init);
  })();
</script>
